  <info>
    <name>Engine Tweaks (More Performance)</name>
    <modid>engine_tweaks</modid>
    <description>Removes the freezes that grow with Henry's item count: looking at a bed, opening or closing the inventory, loot, trade, map and journal screens, and transferring all items.</description>
